%% Diagram source: docs/diagram/event-flow.mmd
sequenceDiagram
  participant H as Hooks
  participant R as PresenceRuntime
  participant B as Process-local event bus
  participant G as Shared V2 registry
  participant P as Typed producer
  participant U as Fixed local presentation
  participant C as cmux

  H->>R: install V2 listeners before session activation
  R->>G: create consumer and activate
  G->>B: consumer.activate callback emits ready v2
  G->>R: replay retained state after ready
  P->>G: activate fixed-source producer
  G->>B: epoch-tagged state v2 + private synchronous receipt
  B->>R: listener calls consumer.accept in delivery stack
  R->>U: fixed source/count + structured-attention projection
  U->>C: status / fixed numeric progress
  P->>G: live terminal v2 (pi or subagent)
  G->>R: accepted terminal edge only
  R->>U: preserve prior cumulative counts and one semantic attention
  U->>C: policy-gated notification
  P->>G: withdraw v2 before bounded-handle rotation
  G->>R: tombstoned source removal
  R->>C: clear exact status / reselect progress
  R->>G: deactivate/reacquire local producer, republish current state
  R->>G: consumer deactivate at session teardown
